    note over App #f4cccc: 8.1 Holder Proof of Possession (signing point 1)

    loop Repeat per holder key
        App->App: Load holder private key (created at wallet activation)\nSecure Enclave (iOS) / Android Keystore / StrongBox
        App->App: Build proof JWT and sign with on-device key\ntyp = openid4vci-proof+jwt , alg = ES256\njwk = holder public key , aud = credential_issuer (from offer) , nonce = c_nonce , iat
    end

    note right of App #wheat:[ENGINE RULE] proof header must contain exactly one of kid or jwk\nnot both and not neither\nWe use jwk because the holder has no DID , a kid starting with did: makes the engine resolve the DID instead\niss must be omitted because a pre-authorized code is used (OpenID4VCI)\nWith key attestation the header must be kid = index of the key in the attestation + key_attestation , without jwk\nthe engine then takes the holder public key from the attestation\nNormally one signature , with batch enabled one proof per key , all sent together

    App->Adapter: [NEW] Request credential with access token + proof JWT | POST /ssi/openid4vci/final-1.0/{credentialSchemaId}/credential (credential_endpoint)\ncredential_configuration_id (from offer) , proofs = { jwt : [ proof JWT ] }
    Adapter->Core: Request credential with access token + proof JWT | POST /ssi/openid4vci/final-1.0/{credentialSchemaId}/credential
    Core->Engine: Request credential with access token + proof JWT | POST /ssi/openid4vci/final-1.0/{credentialSchemaId}/credential (endpoint 47)\naccess token + all proof JWTs

    note over Engine #orange: 8.2 Verify Holder Proof
    Engine->Engine: Check typ is openid4vci-proof+jwt
    Engine->Engine: Check exactly one of kid or jwk , extract holder public key
    Engine->Engine: Verify proof signature with that public key
    Engine->Engine: Check nonce matches and is unused , and aud is this issuer
    Engine->Engine: Check key attestation if the issuer requires it

    alt Proof invalid / offer expired / already used
        Engine-->Core: error
        Core->Core: Update status = ISSUANCE_FAILED
        Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of /ssi credential\n(reason = INVALID_PROOF / OFFER_EXPIRED / OFFER_ALREADY_USED / KEY_ATTESTATION_FAILED)

        note right of Core #wheat:[ERROR AUDIT] failureStep = CREDENTIAL_REQUEST\nreason = INVALID_PROOF / OFFER_EXPIRED / OFFER_ALREADY_USED / KEY_ATTESTATION_FAILED\nerrorCode\nfailedAt\nissuanceSessionId\ncredentialId

        Adapter<--Core: Reject with reason
        App<--Adapter: Reject with reason
        App->DW: [NEW] Report issuance result + Token | POST /v1/virtualcards/issuance_result (DW endpoint 06)\n(issuanceSessionId , result = FAILED , reason)
